OL,3,GNEWSATram services resume after
OL,4,Aderelict pub fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram services are up and running again
OL,7,Fin an area of Nottingham after a fire
OL,8,Fstarted at a derelict pub.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it had sent four engines and an
OL,12,Faerial ladder platform to the blaze at
OL,13,FThe Cricket Players pub in Radford
OL,14,FRoad, in the Hyson Green area of the
OL,15,Fcity on Monday evening.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
