OL,3,GNEWSATram services resume after
OL,4,Aderelict pub fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNET, which operates Nottingham's trams,
OL,7,Fsuspended services in either direction
OL,8,Fbetween Wilkinson Street and The Forest
OL,9,Fdue to the incident. In a later update,
OL,10,Fit said trams were running to all
OL,11,Fdestinations but with extended wait
OL,12,Ftimes.
OL,14,FFirefighters have advised locals to
OL,15,Fkeep their windows and doors shut to
OL,16,Favoid smoke.
